# GitOps Platform Lab

This repository demonstrates a production-style GitOps platform using:

- Kubernetes
- ArgoCD
- ApplicationSet
- Helm
- GitHub Actions
- Terraform
- Prometheus
- Grafana

Architecture:

                    GitHub
                       │
                GitOps Repository
                       │
                  ArgoCD
                       │
               ApplicationSets
                       │
        ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
        ▼              ▼              ▼
   Platform Apps   Monitoring    Business Apps
        │              │              │
        └──────────────┴──────────────┘
                       │
                   Minikube

GitHub -> ArgoCD -> Kubernetes